= Carl Heath

Heath has been Interior Minister for both the Commonwealth Republic and for the state of Heartland, and his priority is using the security services to target the enemies of the republic.

- @prussian_bulwark
- @police_affairs
- @root: Return to main

@prussian_bulwark
title: Heartland Bulwark
subtitle: Heath has influence over Heartland politics.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and marcher_heartland = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not marcher_heartland : The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> is not in control of Heartland. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; heartland_affairs_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: prussian_affairs if in_grand_coalition_heartland == 0 and not in_popular_front_heartland and not in_left_front_heartland; prussian_affairs_dvp if in_grand_coalition_heartland == 1; prussian_affairs_left if in_popular_front_heartland or in_left_front_heartland


@police_affairs
title: Police affairs 
subtitle: We can set our police policy. 
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and marcher_in_government and interior_minister_party == "Marcher"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not marcher_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> is not in government. ?][? if interior_minister_party != "Marcher": The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> does not have the Interior ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; police_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: police

